<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>RO-RO's</p>
<p>Admetos - (built 1983) 17,850 dwt sold to London based buyers for $5.7 million at auction in Durban.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION.</p>
<p>BULKERS.</p>
<p>Chopol - (built 1969) 11,700 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $163 plt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
